“I will design a simplified YouTube-like video streaming system where users can upload videos and other users can watch them. The system is highly read-heavy compared to writes.”

Functional Requirements (keep it short):-
Users can upload videos
Users can watch/stream videos
Users can view video metadata (title, duration, thumbnail)
Videos should support different qualities (e.g., 240p, 720p)

Non Fuctional Requirements :-
Latency (video start time)
Scalability (millions of viewers)
Availability
Durability (uploaded videos shouldn’t be lost)
Performance (smooth playback)

